TYPES:
type entry_id = Entry_id.t
type session_info_entry = { id; timestamp: float; session_id: string; cwd: string; model: Pera_types.Types.model; parent_session_id: string option }
type message_entry = { id; parent_id: entry_id option; timestamp: float; message: Pera_provider.Provider.message }
type leaf_entry = { id; parent_id: entry_id option; timestamp: float }
type model_change_entry = { id; parent_id: entry_id option; timestamp: float; model: Pera_types.Types.model }
type thinking_level_change_entry = { id; parent_id: entry_id option; timestamp: float; thinking_enabled: bool }
type compaction_entry = { id; parent_id: entry_id option; timestamp: float; summary: string; first_kept_entry_id: entry_id }
type session_entry = SessionInfo of session_info_entry | Message of message_entry | Leaf of leaf_entry | ModelChange of model_change_entry | ThinkingLevelChange of thinking_level_change_entry | Compaction of compaction_entry

JSON FORMAT - all entries include: 'id' (string), 'type' (string), 'timestamp' (float). parent_id included only when Some. No null values for absent optionals - omit the key entirely.

type values: 'session_info', 'message', 'leaf', 'model_change', 'thinking_level_change', 'compaction'

MESSAGE_TO_JSON:
UserMessage { role; content } -> {role:'user', content:[...content_blocks...]}
  UText t -> {type:'text', text:t}
  UImage {url;media_type} -> {type:'image', url, media_type}
AssistantMessage { content; stop_reason; provenance; usage } -> {role:'assistant', content:[...], stop_reason:str, provenance:{api,provider,model}, usage:{input_tokens,output_tokens,cache_read_tokens,cache_write_tokens, cost_usd}}
  usage.cost_usd: serialise Decimal.t option as a JSON string via Decimal.to_string when Some; OMIT the cost_usd key entirely when None (no null).
  provenance.error_message included only when Some
  AText t -> {type:'text', text:t}
  AThinking {text;signature} -> {type:'thinking', text, signature:string|omitted}
  AToolCall {id;name;arguments} -> {type:'tool_call', id, name, arguments:<yojson>}
ToolResultMessage {tool_call_id;content;is_error} -> {role:'tool_result', tool_call_id, content, is_error:bool}

STOP_REASON strings: EndTurn->'end_turn', ToolUse->'tool_use', MaxTokens->'max_tokens', StopSequence->'stop_sequence', Error->'error', Aborted->'aborted'

Do not use ppx_deriving.yojson - write manual Yojson.Safe codec. No GADTs. Keep codec functions in session_types.ml (not a separate file).

